ccession_id  and cyclin  removed_accession_id    removed_accession_id  stain showed many follicular dendritic meshworks  many of which are expanded  the follicles are positive for  removed_accession_id  and  removed_accession_id  and negative for  removed_accession_id   with antibodies to t lineage associated antigen s    removed_accession_id    removed_accession_id    there is staining of many small cells in the interfollicular region  with antibody to  removed_accession_id   many scattered immunoblasts and plasma cells are stained  the cells are negative for  removed_accession_id   together with the morphologic features on routine sections  these results do not establish a definite diagnosis  and cannot rule out a b cell lymphoma  see note  note  these tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the pathology department at the massachusetts general hospital  they have not been cleared or approved by the u s  food and drug administration  fda   the fda has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  added by  nancy lee harris  m d  signed on  22 aug 03 at 18 03 gross description  received in formalin   labeled remove_patient_name  patient s name and unit number only  are four cores of fibrofatty tissue ranging from removed_date x 0 2cm to removed_date x 0 2cm which are submitted in toto as cassette a  gross description by  julie zwirble resident  paul n  staats  md                                                                                 source care unit  mgh outpatient  off p clinic  reports to  kevin s  hughes  m d  isaac schiff  m d  dianne georgian smith  m d  kenneth lloyd minaker  m d  part   breast  right 1 00   core biopsy , benign.
